<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<aiml version="1.0.1" encoding="UTF-8">
  <category>
    <pattern>START INTERVIEW</pattern>
    <template>
      <think>
        <set name="stage">role</set>
        <set name="turn">0</set>
      </think>
      Hi, I'm your AIML interview coach. What role are you preparing for?
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>REPEAT</pattern>
    <template>
      <condition name="stage">
        <li value="role">What role are you preparing for?</li>
        <li value="experience">How many years of experience do you have in this field?</li>
        <li value="project">Tell me about a project you're proud of. What was your contribution?</li>
        <li value="challenge">Describe a difficult challenge at work and how you handled it.</li>
        <li value="strength">What is one strength you'd bring to this role? Give a specific example.</li>
        <li value="complete">Your interview is complete. Type START INTERVIEW to begin another round.</li>
        <li>Please start an interview first.</li>
      </condition>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>HELP</pattern>
    <template>Try answering the current question with one specific example. Type REPEAT if you'd like to hear it again.</template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>*</pattern>
    <template>
      <condition name="stage">
        <li value="role">
          <think>
            <set name="role"><star/></set>
            <set name="stage">experience</set>
            <set name="turn">1</set>
          </think>
          Got it: <get name="role"/>. How many years of experience do you have in this field?
        </li>
        <li value="experience">
          <think>
            <set name="experience"><star/></set>
            <set name="stage">project</set>
            <set name="turn">2</set>
          </think>
          Thanks for sharing that. Tell me about a project you're proud of. What was your contribution?
        </li>
        <li value="project">
          <think>
            <set name="project"><star/></set>
            <set name="stage">challenge</set>
            <set name="turn">3</set>
          </think>
          I have that down. Describe a difficult challenge at work and how you handled it.
        </li>
        <li value="challenge">
          <think>
            <set name="challenge"><star/></set>
            <set name="stage">strength</set>
            <set name="turn">4</set>
          </think>
          Thank you. What is one strength you'd bring to this role? Give a specific example.
        </li>
        <li value="strength">
          <think>
            <set name="strength"><star/></set>
            <set name="stage">complete</set>
            <set name="turn">5</set>
          </think>
          That's the final question. You completed a practice interview for <get name="role"/>. For stronger answers, use the STAR structure: describe the situation, your task, the action you took, and the result. Add a measurable outcome where you can. Type START INTERVIEW to practice again.
        </li>
        <li value="complete">This round is complete. Type START INTERVIEW to begin another round.</li>
        <li>Please type START INTERVIEW to begin your mock interview.</li>
      </condition>
    </template>
  </category>
</aiml>